@title EPISODE 27 • ALEXA'S SHOW
@bg art_gallery_night
@show alexa
Alexa has a piece in the student art show. She didn't tell anyone. Paris found out from the flyer.
Paris: You drew the TEAM. All of us. Alexa, this is gorgeous.
Alexa: (staring at the floor) It's not finished. Nothing's ever finished.
In the corner of the painting there's a boy mid-jump. Triple jump. Unmistakably Zane.
@show zane
Zane: (arriving with flowers, nervous) Paris said I should come. Is that... me?
Alexa wants to disappear into the wall.
> [Bold] "Yes, that's you. She stares at you at practice." -> x1
> [Good] Drag Paris away. Give them space. -> x2
> [Bitchy] "Zane, just ask her out. Painful to watch." -> x3
> [Sweet] "Alexa, tell him what the painting's called." -> x4
*x1
@add Alexa_Friendship -1
@add Alexa_Zane 2
Alexa: LONDON.
Zane: (grinning) I stare at her too. Like, a lot. Coach Rhodes yells at me.
@jump x_done
*x2
@add Alexa_Friendship 2
@add Alexa_Zane 2
From the snack table you watch Zane say something that makes Alexa laugh — the real laugh, the one only Paris usually gets.
@jump x_done
*x3
@add Alexa_Zane 1
@add Alexa_Friendship -1
Zane: Okay! Alexa — coffee? Tomorrow? Please say yes. London's watching.
Alexa: (tiny smile) ...Yes. Mostly to make her leave.
@jump x_done
*x4
@add Alexa_Friendship 3
@add Alexa_Zane 3
Alexa: (barely a whisper) It's called "The Ones Who Stayed."
Zane looks at the painting. Then at her. He doesn't say anything clever. He just takes her hand.
*x_done
@hide
@bg art_gallery_night
@show diggy
Across the gallery, London spots him. Diggy. Standing in front of the painting. In the corner, behind the boy mid-jump: a girl in a white headband and a boy in a grey hoodie, running side by side.
Diggy: (not looking at her) She got your arm swing right.
London: She got yours wrong.
Diggy: (smiling) Yeah, she made it look good.
